# Install as /usr/lib/sysusers.d/agentcapsule-authority.conf (systemd-sysusers).
# The authority service's own user: it owns both authority directories (or the
# replica's on the standby) and the link's private key. The group
# agentcapsule-authority-clients may reach the API socket; the worker reaches
# its socket as root. From wave 4 of ADR 006, add the API's account:
#   m <the API's account> agentcapsule-authority-clients
u agentcapsule-authority - "Agent Capsule authority service" - -
g agentcapsule-authority-clients -
